    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.ai\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\nWhen i do an action like `ci\"` or similar on a long line:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b285257-1047-41ed-a36c-3123df895f4b)\n\nIt shifts focus of the visible portion of a buffer incorrectly:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac0422c8-2313-4ef3-b16b-0b53aecb8e62)\n\nWithout the plugin there is no such behavior:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd4712ef-d5fd-4e99-b5f9-1af36610f7ef)\n\n### Reproduction\n\n1. Create separate 'nvim-repro' config directory:\n    - '~/.config/nvim-repro/' on Unix\n\n2. Inside 'nvim-repro' directory create a file named 'init.lua'.\n   Populate it with the following content:\n\n    ```lua\n    vim.cmd('echo \"Installing `mini.nvim`\" | redraw')\n    local mini_path = vim.fn.stdpath('data') .. '/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim'\n    local clone_cmd = { 'git', 'clone', '--depth=1', 'https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim', mini_path }\n    vim.fn.system(clone_cmd)\n    vim.cmd('echo \"`mini.nvim` is installed\" | redraw')\n\n    -- Make sure 'mini.nvim' is available\n    vim.cmd('packadd mini.nvim')\n    require('mini.deps').setup()\n    require('mini.ai').setup()\n    vim.opt.wrap = false\n    ```\n\n3. Run `NVIM_APPNAME=nvim-repro nvim`\n\n4. Paste this:\n`        logging.warning(f\"Remote {gitlab_remote_url} doesn't have any hash: {gitlab_hash}\\nTrying to push to gitlab remote.\")`\n\n5. Execute `C-w v`, so that the line is not fully visible. From the very start of the line do `ci\"`.\n\nThis is how it was before `ci\"`:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f21073d-91f6-4830-addd-a82c79cff934)\n\nThis is how it looks after:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/adad27d6-ba85-4d9d-9648-40307e5db3e3)",
