        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nYes, I can reproduce. I'll take a look at it, but my first impression is that this will be either trivially fixed (unlikely) or not fixeable a all (likely) due to how custom Operator-pending textobjects work.\n\nFor example, you see the same \"scrolling\" behavior with `nvim --clean` if you do `vi\"` and then press `c`. As Operator-pending textobjects are defined via making targeted visual selection, this is likely to keep happening.",
